1
00:01:35,789 --> 00:01:40,000
[Abyss]

2
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:51,820
[October, 2004]

3
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:19,110
Captain Zhao.

4
00:03:36,790 --> 00:03:41,150
[Episode 1]

5
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:46,110
[Huangshui County, Xihai City;
8 years later, 2012]

6
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:04,790
[Huangzhiyuan Hotel]

7
00:04:06,180 --> 00:04:08,410
Chen Chunli!

8
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,370
Just go!

9
00:04:09,230 --> 00:04:10,390
[Welcome to Huangzhiyuan Hotel]

10
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:10,470
Chen Chunli!

11
00:04:10,470 --> 00:04:11,530
Stop yelling. Stop, please.

12
00:04:11,530 --> 00:04:12,500
Just leave.

13
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:13,340
Chunli!

14
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:14,410
Sir! Sir...

15
00:04:14,410 --> 00:04:15,580
-Chunli!
-Sir.

16
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,010
That's not how you pursue a woman.

17
00:04:17,010 --> 00:04:18,630
-Chunli.
-You've scared her off so many times.

18
00:04:18,630 --> 00:04:19,100
Song!

19
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:19,769
Chunli!

20
00:04:19,769 --> 00:04:20,930
Come give me a hand!

21
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:21,870
Well, you...

22
00:04:21,870 --> 00:04:23,070
-Stop shouting, sir.
-Chunli!

23
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:23,770
Sir!

24
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:24,430
Chunli.

25
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:25,830
Stop making a scene here!

26
00:04:27,150 --> 00:04:29,010
Just get him out of here, will you?

27
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:32,040
Chunli,

28
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:33,690
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

29
00:04:33,690 --> 00:04:35,680
Manager Zhang, I told you last time.

30
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,250
I don't know him well. I really don't!

31
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:38,780
It's no use calling me here.

32
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:40,420
He's calling your name,
and you still say you don't know him?

33
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:41,810
Who else knows him besides you and Song?

34
00:04:41,810 --> 00:04:44,010
His name is Xin Jiran; you know that too.

35
00:04:44,130 --> 00:04:45,790
Maybe he came looking for you.

36
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,700
Still denying it, huh, Chen Chunli?

37
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:48,640
You still want this job or not?

38
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:49,820
I do.

39
00:04:50,610 --> 00:04:51,810
But I can't handle this.

40
00:04:51,810 --> 00:04:53,340
Calling me here is useless.

41
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:55,500
Call the police.

42
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,610
You... well...

43
00:04:56,890 --> 00:04:57,540
Chunli...

44
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:58,540
-You...
-Chunli.

45
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,430
Chunli.

46
00:04:59,430 --> 00:05:00,370
Enough already. Come on, come on!

47
00:05:00,370 --> 00:05:00,750
Chunli.

48
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:02,350
That drunkard is really shameless.

49
00:05:02,350 --> 00:05:03,570
Just look at him.

50
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:05,240
How could Chen Chunli fancy him?

51
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:05,890
Mom!

52
00:05:06,330 --> 00:05:07,770
Son.

53
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,800
How was it? Your fitness test results?

54
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,630
Pretty good.

55
00:05:11,930 --> 00:05:13,270
My son is modest.

56
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:14,370
If he says it's pretty good,

57
00:05:14,370 --> 00:05:15,980
then it must be excellent.

58
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:17,570
Congratulations.

59
00:05:17,570 --> 00:05:19,870
From now on,
we'll have to call you Officer Li.

60
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:22,060
It's still a few months
before I officially start.

61
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:24,220
The rest is just a formality.

62
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:27,200
Second in the whole province
on the written exam.

63
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,730
That's really impressive.

64
00:05:28,930 --> 00:05:31,470
We really envy you
for having such an excellent son.

65
00:05:31,470 --> 00:05:32,700
Come, let me carry it.

66
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,220
I'm telling you,

67
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:37,060
I really disapproved of him
coming back right after graduation.

68
00:05:37,060 --> 00:05:38,430
With such good grades

69
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,450
and such a high level of education,

70
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:41,180
he should've been off
making it in some big city.

71
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:42,070
But no,

72
00:05:42,250 --> 00:05:43,200
he insisted on coming back,

73
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:45,370
saying he wanted to look after me.
Can you believe it?

74
00:05:45,370 --> 00:05:46,330
Do I look like I'm at the age

75
00:05:46,330 --> 00:05:48,070
where I need looking after?

76
00:05:48,130 --> 00:05:49,120
I'm telling you,

77
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:50,420
once kids grow up,

78
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,130
you can't control them anymore.

79
00:05:52,130 --> 00:05:54,560
He comes here to make trouble
whenever he gets drunk.

80
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,810
-Careful.
-This is really affecting our business.

81
00:05:56,810 --> 00:05:57,930
I-It also affects our county's

82
00:05:57,930 --> 00:05:58,980
GDP, right?

83
00:05:58,980 --> 00:05:59,980
Can't you just lock him up

84
00:05:59,980 --> 00:06:01,360
and be done with it?

85
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,430
What, are you teaching me
how to do my job?

86
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:05,410
Maybe you should be the cop, then.

87
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:06,980
Chunli...

88
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,180
Stop calling Chunli.

89
00:06:08,180 --> 00:06:08,680
Chunli...

90
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,130
Move, move.

91
00:06:09,130 --> 00:06:09,570
Listen to me...

92
00:06:09,570 --> 00:06:10,240
Say what? Move.

93
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:10,930
Chunli.

94
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:11,600
Honestly, what does he think

95
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,680
this place is?

96
00:06:14,870 --> 00:06:15,800
Enough, enough.

97
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:16,960
Li Guangwen!

98
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:18,580
[Public Security]

99
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,190
How's that favor

100
00:06:19,010 --> 00:06:19,740
[Public Security]

101
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,060
I asked you for?

102
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:20,930
We'll talk later.

103
00:06:20,930 --> 00:06:22,090
I'm on duty.

104
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,130
Are you even reliable or not?

105
00:06:24,150 --> 00:06:25,540
Didn't we agree?

106
00:06:24,250 --> 00:06:27,180
[Police]

107
00:06:30,050 --> 00:06:30,740
Li Cheng!

108
00:06:30,230 --> 00:06:30,660
[Public Security]

109
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:31,820
Come here.

110
00:06:32,420 --> 00:06:35,380
[Public Security]

111
00:06:32,890 --> 00:06:33,710
Uncle Li.

112
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:36,460
Did you pass
the written exam and the interview?

113
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:37,180
Yes, I did.

114
00:06:37,180 --> 00:06:38,180
And his grades were excellent.

115
00:06:38,180 --> 00:06:39,770
Your son's got it all going for him.

116
00:06:39,770 --> 00:06:41,420
His future is bright.

117
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,190
Why do you need a lowly beat cop like me

118
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,159
to pull strings for you?

119
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:46,659
We just want to help him
get ahead a little faster.

120
00:06:46,659 --> 00:06:48,670
I... I didn't hear anything.

121
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,650
Um, Li Cheng.

122
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,070
Besides doing well in school,

123
00:06:53,070 --> 00:06:55,040
do you have any other special skills?

124
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,440
I can run full marathons.

125
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,690
Can you play table tennis?

126
00:06:58,690 --> 00:07:00,500
Table tennis, badminton, basketball,

127
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:02,190
and even most e-sports games out there—

128
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:02,920
I know a bit of everything.

129
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,130
My son is modest.

130
00:07:04,130 --> 00:07:05,010
When he says he knows a bit,

131
00:07:05,010 --> 00:07:06,850
that means he's actually
really good at it.

132
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:07,520
Got it?

133
00:07:07,550 --> 00:07:08,400
Got it, got it.

134
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:09,930
What are you laughing at?

135
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:11,150
Li Guangwen!

136
00:07:11,570 --> 00:07:13,540
Listen, we were classmates.

137
00:07:13,540 --> 00:07:15,000
Back when you were pursuing me, you...

138
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,600
Don't talk nonsense! You...

139
00:07:16,690 --> 00:07:17,860
I'll call you later.

140
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:18,950
Wait!

141
00:07:19,790 --> 00:07:21,400
[Police]

142
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:22,920
What did I even say?
Why are you running off?

143
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:25,450
All grown up
and still running away like that.

144
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:33,180
[Public Security]

145
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,060
[Police]

146
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:35,960
We're here?

147
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,659
What are you doing?

148
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:46,830
What is he going to do?

149
00:07:56,490 --> 00:07:57,620
Spend it sparingly.

150
00:08:08,900 --> 00:08:11,510
[Public Security]

151
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:17,740
[Huangshui Public Security]

152
00:08:15,250 --> 00:08:16,100
You're here.

153
00:08:17,950 --> 00:08:19,200
How much did you give him?

154
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:19,930
Two hundred.

155
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:26,280
[Huangshui Public Security]

156
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:24,240
Zhao was generous last month.

157
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:26,180
He gave him 300 right off the bat.

158
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:29,260
No wonder he's been
mooching off me lately.

159
00:08:29,420 --> 00:08:31,120
Next month is Zhao's turn again.

160
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:33,039
Tell him not to give so much every time.

161
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:33,919
Understood.

162
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,650
Last time Zhao gave him the money,

163
00:08:35,650 --> 00:08:37,510
Xin was drunk for 3 days straight.

164
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:40,250
We've really turned him into a drunkard.

165
00:08:40,250 --> 00:08:42,600
Tell him to save some of it
and buy more food instead.

166
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,630
Got it.

167
00:08:48,090 --> 00:08:49,800
Zhao, gout acting up again?

168
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:53,510
I sneaked some lamb offal
behind my wife's back.

169
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,700
Didn't expect karma to hit so fast.

170
00:08:59,200 --> 00:08:59,590
Captain Fan.

171
00:08:59,590 --> 00:09:00,230
Captain Fan.

172
00:09:00,230 --> 00:09:00,700
Captain Fan.

173
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:01,360
Come on,

174
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,020
gather around if you're free.

175
00:09:03,130 --> 00:09:04,120
I'll say a few words.

176
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,010
If you've got something to say, say it.

177
00:09:05,010 --> 00:09:06,290
If you've got leads, bring them forward.

178
00:09:06,290 --> 00:09:07,010
We're criminal investigators.

179
00:09:07,010 --> 00:09:07,870
We should either be out at the scene

180
00:09:07,870 --> 00:09:09,200
or chasing leads.

181
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:11,120
Sitting in meetings all day,
cooped up indoors—

182
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,650
that's just a waste of time.

183
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:13,770
Zhao, with that foot of yours,

184
00:09:13,770 --> 00:09:14,840
forget about going to a scene—

185
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,500
it's hard enough for you to walk.

186
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,200
Dropping the ball at crucial moments,

187
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,410
that's Zhao for you.

188
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:21,120
Officers,

189
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,500
the new recruits

190
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:23,450
will be reporting in soon.

191
00:09:23,450 --> 00:09:24,210
I took a look,

192
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,360
and there are a few good ones this year.

193
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:29,240
This year, let Zhao get first pick.

194
00:09:29,460 --> 00:09:32,460
So he won't keep saying
he's better than me at everything,

195
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:34,520
except when it comes to apprentices.

196
00:09:35,790 --> 00:09:38,360
I've got my own plans
for taking in apprentices.

197
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,100
Are you done?

198
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:39,740
Yeah.

199
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:41,010
Hurry up and leave then.

200
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:42,530
Your buzzing makes my pain worse.

201
00:09:42,530 --> 00:09:43,530
Serves you right.

202
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:52,750
Yours.

203
00:09:54,370 --> 00:09:55,240
That's all?

204
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:56,620
The doctor said

205
00:09:56,620 --> 00:09:57,790
your gout

206
00:09:57,790 --> 00:10:00,050
is caused by obesity.

207
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:03,620
As long as you lose that fat,

208
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:05,510
all your problems will go away.

209
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:07,840
But this is too little...

210
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,580
Zip it.

211
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,890
Wasn't this tray
the one Zhao Ying used when she was 3?

212
00:10:20,330 --> 00:10:22,730
Where did you dig it up?

213
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:26,110
I'll take it away if you don't eat.

214
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:27,350
The doctor said

215
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:30,580
fasting helps you lose weight faster.

216
00:10:59,620 --> 00:11:00,350
You're here.

217
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:03,790
Hello, sir.

218
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:06,980
Come in.

219
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,240
I've brought the boy to you.

220
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,360
I won't go in then.

221
00:11:09,530 --> 00:11:12,550
What are you hanging back for?
I'm not putting you to work.

222
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:13,390
Guangwen, you're here.

223
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:14,360
Hello, Mrs. Zhao.

224
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,620
You're heading to the hospital
for your shift, right?

225
00:11:16,620 --> 00:11:17,340
I'm driving.

226
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:18,500
Let me give you a ride.

227
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:19,360
Aren't you coming in?

228
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,000
No.

229
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:21,770
I was actually worried
I couldn't get a cab.

230
00:11:21,770 --> 00:11:22,650
Thanks for the ride, then.

231
00:11:22,650 --> 00:11:23,650
Don't mention it.

232
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,510
Don't forget
your evening table tennis session.

233
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:28,890
You've practiced
your backhand loop for so long.

234
00:11:28,890 --> 00:11:30,220
Don't let it go to waste.

235
00:11:30,530 --> 00:11:31,260
Don't worry.

236
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,160
Come in, then.

237
00:11:41,370 --> 00:11:41,740
Sit.

238
00:11:48,770 --> 00:11:50,550
What did Li Guangwen tell you?

239
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:53,840
Uncle Li said your name is Zhao Ganzhe,

240
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:58,020
Vice Captain of the County Public Security Bureau's
Criminal Investigation Brigade.

241
00:11:58,020 --> 00:12:00,880
Didn't he tell you
about my glorious deeds?

242
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:03,870
He did.

243
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:06,200
He said your nickname is "Old Foodie,"

244
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,390
and you can eat
6 bowls of rice at one meal.

245
00:12:07,390 --> 00:12:08,590
That's pure slander!

246
00:12:09,030 --> 00:12:10,170
What gives him the right to say that?

247
00:12:10,170 --> 00:12:11,970
Since when do I eat off his plate?

248
00:12:15,980 --> 00:12:17,370
My daughter is taking
the college entrance exam next year,

249
00:12:17,370 --> 00:12:19,030
so let's keep our voices down.

250
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:20,480
Understood.

251
00:12:21,890 --> 00:12:23,490
Where did you graduate from?

252
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:25,220
The provincial police academy.

253
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:27,280
Why do you want to be a police officer?

254
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:29,460
I love watching crime dramas.

255
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:31,590
I think police officers are very cool.

256
00:12:32,860 --> 00:12:34,870
Do I look cool to you?

257
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:35,850
Zhao!

258
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:41,360
Didn't I tell you to keep your voice down?

259
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,700
Let's go talk somewhere else.

260
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:06,130
I can't go on anymore.

261
00:13:06,130 --> 00:13:06,890
So tired.

262
00:13:07,030 --> 00:13:08,130
Let's take a break.

263
00:13:09,770 --> 00:13:10,610
Sorry.

264
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:11,380
Thank you.

265
00:13:11,510 --> 00:13:12,460
Making a pro like you

266
00:13:12,460 --> 00:13:14,570
waste your time with me, an amateur.

267
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,370
Not at all.

268
00:13:16,130 --> 00:13:17,290
I have no choice.

269
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,720
Orders from my wife—can't disobey.

270
00:13:19,860 --> 00:13:21,640
Your backhand is your strong suit.

271
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:22,700
When we get the chance later,

272
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:24,830
I'll help you practice your forehand more.

273
00:13:24,830 --> 00:13:26,490
You want to
become a police officer that badly.

274
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:29,030
Do you want to
join the Criminal Investigation Corps?

275
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:30,670
I studied for 4 years
at the police academy,

276
00:13:30,670 --> 00:13:32,220
specifically to become
a criminal police officer.

277
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:34,820
Being a criminal police officer
is tough work.

278
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,480
I'm prepared for that.

279
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:43,480
I'm always glad to
take younger officers under my wing.

280
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:45,780
Would you like to test yourself to see

281
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,870
if you have what it takes to become

282
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:49,070
an excellent criminal police officer?

283
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:50,700
How?

284
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:53,950
There's an internet cafe
on Daxin Street. Know it?

285
00:13:53,990 --> 00:13:54,760
Yes.

286
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:56,010
Benteng Internet Cafe.

287
00:13:55,150 --> 00:13:57,430
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

288
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:59,040
Within one week, get close to its owner.

289
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:01,220
Figure out his social circle

290
00:14:01,260 --> 00:14:02,740
and what he does every day.

291
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:05,000
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

292
00:14:04,530 --> 00:14:06,570
Then what's the background of that owner?

293
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:07,860
A drug dealer or...

294
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,500
Or some gang boss?

295
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:12,300
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

296
00:14:10,670 --> 00:14:11,390
Theoretically,

297
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:14,220
he's not a suspect in any case.

298
00:14:14,510 --> 00:14:16,970
Otherwise, it wouldn't be
your turn, right?

299
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,740
This is just a small exercise

300
00:14:18,740 --> 00:14:20,600
to assess your capabilities.

301
00:14:21,010 --> 00:14:21,870
So?

302
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:24,220
Are you up for the challenge?

303
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:27,140
I guarantee I'll complete the mission!

304
00:14:29,190 --> 00:14:30,690
Zone A is 3 yuan per hour,

305
00:14:30,210 --> 00:14:30,810
[Benteng Internet Cafe; Zone A]

306
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,740
Zone B is 2.

307
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:33,390
The private rooms
on the 2nd floor are full.

308
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:35,390
In Zone A, any seat except A3 is free.

309
00:14:44,630 --> 00:14:45,250
Sir,

310
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:47,550
could you give me more information

311
00:14:47,550 --> 00:14:48,960
about him?

312
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:51,220
The owner's name is Han Pinmu,

313
00:14:51,220 --> 00:14:52,910
28 years old, a local.

314
00:14:53,170 --> 00:14:55,040
Graduated from
the No. 1 County High School.

315
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:56,460
He never went to university

316
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:58,550
and never left Huangshui for long.

317
00:14:59,010 --> 00:14:59,820
His father funded this internet cafe

318
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:01,770
for him before he passed away.

319
00:15:01,790 --> 00:15:03,630
He likes to play games with regulars.

320
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:05,820
Guangwen said you're good at games.

321
00:15:05,930 --> 00:15:08,540
Maybe he'll come up and talk to you first.

322
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:27,940
Nice!

323
00:15:35,410 --> 00:15:36,810
Aren't you off shift yet?

324
00:15:37,670 --> 00:15:38,980
Yu has something to do at noon

325
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:41,080
and has asked me to
cover for her this morning.

326
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,030
I told you yesterday
I've got a match at noon today.

327
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:43,980
Why is A4

328
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:44,910
still occupied?

329
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:47,630
That customer came in at 8 last night.

330
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:50,780
And he's been playing
straight through till now?

331
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:58,180
Keep an eye on people like that
in the future,

332
00:15:58,370 --> 00:15:59,900
in case they drop dead here.

333
00:16:12,060 --> 00:16:12,720
Hey, buddy.

334
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:15,110
Buddy?

335
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:18,330
Buddy.

336
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:21,460
What's wrong?

337
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:22,510
Excuse me,

338
00:16:22,510 --> 00:16:24,600
I'm the owner here.

339
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,460
I made an appointment
with someone yesterday

340
00:16:26,460 --> 00:16:28,240
to play a match here at noon.

341
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:30,770
We usually like to sit in this row,

342
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:33,440
so could you please
move to another computer?

343
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:35,300
I've been playing here all night,

344
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:36,960
and now you're kicking me out?

345
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:38,730
How about this?

346
00:16:38,820 --> 00:16:41,030
I'll waive your overnight fee.

347
00:16:41,050 --> 00:16:42,280
Really?

348
00:16:42,300 --> 00:16:43,410
That generous?

349
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,280
Alright then.

350
00:16:46,090 --> 00:16:46,830
Thanks.

351
00:16:58,900 --> 00:17:00,700
Your computers are pretty good.

352
00:17:02,350 --> 00:17:04,140
We upgraded them just this year.

353
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:05,510
Do you have any DOTA

354
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:06,680
or Warcraft 3C pros?

355
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:08,589
Yeah, quite a few.

356
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,900
But most of them have switched to TOT now.

357
00:17:12,220 --> 00:17:13,050
TOT?

358
00:17:15,369 --> 00:17:16,460
New game?

359
00:17:15,770 --> 00:17:16,390
[TOT]

360
00:17:17,170 --> 00:17:18,630
It just came out recently.

361
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:21,460
[Log in]

362
00:17:22,859 --> 00:17:24,190
I haven't played it yet.

363
00:17:27,490 --> 00:17:28,270
I'm off.

364
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:30,050
Thanks.

365
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:31,140
Don't mention it.

366
00:17:35,390 --> 00:17:36,520
Come and take a look.

367
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,640
How much are these jujubes?

368
00:17:41,050 --> 00:17:41,940
Seven yuan.

369
00:17:42,810 --> 00:17:43,750
That expensive?

370
00:17:44,130 --> 00:17:46,260
They're 5 yuan at the market entrance.

371
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:47,920
Then go buy them there.

372
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:51,090
Don't you even know how to do business?

373
00:18:11,210 --> 00:18:12,480
Can you play table tennis?

374
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:14,180
Table tennis, badminton, basketball,

375
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:15,830
and even most e-sports games out there—

376
00:18:15,830 --> 00:18:17,290
I know a bit of everything.

377
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,090
No need to act so sneaky.

378
00:18:49,090 --> 00:18:50,950
That makes you more conspicuous.

379
00:18:54,980 --> 00:18:55,840
How's it going?

380
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,050
I've been up for almost 40 hours straight.

381
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:00,980
Did you get anything?

382
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:03,600
The target appears amiable

383
00:19:03,630 --> 00:19:04,570
and generous,

384
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:05,970
doesn't smoke or drink,

385
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:07,830
and loves playing games
but doesn't stay up late.

386
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:09,050
He keeps a very regular routine.

387
00:19:09,050 --> 00:19:11,330
Usually, he lives
on the 2nd floor of the internet cafe.

388
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:12,850
Half of the 2nd floor is private rooms,

389
00:19:12,850 --> 00:19:14,220
and the other half is his living space.

390
00:19:14,220 --> 00:19:15,960
He goes jogging every morning—

391
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,180
about 35 minutes.

392
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:20,880
The rest of the time,
he's mostly in the internet cafe.

393
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:22,790
The internet cafe is open 24 hours.

394
00:19:22,790 --> 00:19:23,830
Besides Han Pinmu,

395
00:19:23,830 --> 00:19:25,390
there are 5 other staff members.

396
00:19:25,390 --> 00:19:26,390
Two attendants,

397
00:19:26,420 --> 00:19:27,290
two receptionists,

398
00:19:27,290 --> 00:19:28,220
and one cleaner.

399
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:29,640
The day shift attendant is Wei,

400
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:30,740
and the receptionist is Yu.

401
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:33,060
The night shift attendant is Kun,

402
00:19:33,090 --> 00:19:34,160
and the receptionist is Ms. Hong.

403
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:36,430
The cleaner, Ms. Sun,
only works the day shift.

404
00:19:36,430 --> 00:19:37,240
That's all.

405
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:38,400
Not bad.

406
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:40,810
But my task for you

407
00:19:40,810 --> 00:19:43,170
is to get close to Han Pinmu.

408
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,770
We've already talked.

409
00:19:45,420 --> 00:19:47,380
Didn't you say I had a week?

410
00:19:47,930 --> 00:19:49,190
I don't want to make it look
too deliberate.

411
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:51,090
The persona I've created for myself is

412
00:19:51,090 --> 00:19:52,390
that of a college graduate

413
00:19:52,390 --> 00:19:53,940
who hasn't found a decent job

414
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,010
and has been unemployed ever since—

415
00:19:55,010 --> 00:19:57,180
a skilled gamer with a rebellious streak.

416
00:19:57,180 --> 00:19:58,700
I'll use my gaming skills

417
00:19:58,700 --> 00:20:01,560
to get Han Pinmu
to strike up a conversation with me.

418
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:04,620
But I have a question.

419
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,460
Why are you investigating Han Pinmu?

420
00:20:14,220 --> 00:20:15,550
Didn't I tell you?

421
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:18,200
It's just a test. A test.

422
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,220
If I were stupid,

423
00:20:20,220 --> 00:20:22,480
I wouldn't be able to finish
what you've assigned me.

424
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,680
And if I'm not stupid—

425
00:20:24,270 --> 00:20:25,900
do you really expect me to believe that?

426
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:26,980
If you don't want to do it,

427
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:27,850
get off and leave.

428
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:28,750
Delete my number.

429
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:30,080
I'll find someone else.

430
00:20:31,350 --> 00:20:32,630
Are you in or out?

431
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:38,090
Sir,

432
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,380
I can go without an answer right now,

433
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:42,310
but I can't go without one forever.

434
00:20:45,110 --> 00:20:46,240
Once this test is over,

435
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:47,040
I'll tell you.

436
00:20:58,290 --> 00:21:01,100
[Xiaofei; Incoming Call]

437
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:09,850
Hello.

438
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:11,110
Han.

439
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,480
What's wrong?

440
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:15,470
I can't take it anymore.

441
00:21:16,110 --> 00:21:17,450
I want to die.

442
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:21,310
We agreed we'd wait a little longer.

443
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:22,240
You promised me.

444
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,700
I... I can't...

445
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,050
I can't take it anymore.

446
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:28,240
I can't take it anymore.

447
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:37,320
Xiaoliang barked.

448
00:21:38,890 --> 00:21:40,350
Why is Xiaoliang barking?

449
00:21:41,960 --> 00:21:43,290
There's no one outside.

450
00:21:43,870 --> 00:21:45,470
It must be them coming for me.

451
00:21:45,860 --> 00:21:47,460
They've come for me.

452
00:21:47,990 --> 00:21:49,070
They've come for me.

453
00:21:49,070 --> 00:21:50,200
They've come for me.

454
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,140
I'm not going to make it.

455
00:21:53,140 --> 00:21:54,970
Ms. Hong, give me the car keys.

456
00:22:27,530 --> 00:22:28,140
Hey!

457
00:22:28,220 --> 00:22:29,110
-Go.
-Who the hell are you?

458
00:22:29,110 --> 00:22:29,570
Hey!

459
00:22:58,030 --> 00:22:59,810
Sir, don't follow too closely.

460
00:23:11,750 --> 00:23:13,220
Sir, why did we stop?

461
00:23:13,270 --> 00:23:14,930
This is as far as I can take you.

462
00:23:14,940 --> 00:23:15,850
Company policy—

463
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:17,210
we can't leave the county after 10 PM.

464
00:23:17,210 --> 00:23:18,070
I'll pay extra.

465
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:20,090
N-Not even for extra money.

466
00:23:20,090 --> 00:23:21,850
It's late, and there's nothing
but wasteland out there.

467
00:23:21,850 --> 00:23:23,830
-You don't even know where you're going.
-I'll pay extra!

468
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:24,810
Go, get out!

469
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:26,160
Find another way!

470
00:23:27,420 --> 00:23:28,290
Get out!

471
00:24:49,940 --> 00:24:51,270
This game is pretty fun,

472
00:24:51,570 --> 00:24:53,100
but harder than I expected.

473
00:24:53,460 --> 00:24:54,920
You're picking it up pretty fast, though.

474
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:56,350
Your mechanics are solid.

475
00:24:56,350 --> 00:24:57,680
Players who switch from 3C to TOT

476
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:59,210
usually have an advantage.

477
00:24:59,850 --> 00:25:01,050
You from around here?

478
00:25:02,010 --> 00:25:03,270
What, I don't look like one?

479
00:25:03,270 --> 00:25:06,130
Then why would you
just come to my internet cafe now?

480
00:25:06,310 --> 00:25:08,610
My family used to live in
the chemical plant housing complex,

481
00:25:08,610 --> 00:25:09,810
but it's too remote over there,

482
00:25:09,810 --> 00:25:11,220
so we only just moved here.

483
00:25:11,220 --> 00:25:12,680
Where do you live now then?

484
00:25:14,150 --> 00:25:16,110
What, do internet cafes
have their own turf now?

485
00:25:16,110 --> 00:25:18,180
No, we often play matches
and do boosting gigs

486
00:25:18,180 --> 00:25:19,070
in the middle of the night.

487
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,930
Living close is more convenient.

488
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:22,330
Have you found a job?

489
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:24,350
Tried in the provincial capital,

490
00:25:24,350 --> 00:25:25,510
but nothing worked out.

491
00:25:25,510 --> 00:25:28,190
I haven't found anything suitable
since coming back either.

492
00:25:28,190 --> 00:25:28,930
What a coincidence.

493
00:25:28,930 --> 00:25:31,330
Why don't you come
work at my internet cafe?

494
00:25:31,940 --> 00:25:33,940
My mom thinks
being an attendant at an internet cafe

495
00:25:33,940 --> 00:25:35,180
is just playing games all day,

496
00:25:35,180 --> 00:25:36,160
not a real job.

497
00:25:45,070 --> 00:25:46,000
How about this?

498
00:25:46,020 --> 00:25:48,540
Get your rating up to 1,600 first,

499
00:25:48,570 --> 00:25:49,250
okay?

500
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:51,230
Once you do,
I'll add you to our team group chat,

501
00:25:51,230 --> 00:25:53,030
arrange some internet cafe matches
for you,

502
00:25:53,030 --> 00:25:54,530
and have you help
boost clients' rankings, things like that.

503
00:25:54,530 --> 00:25:55,860
You can make some money.

504
00:25:56,750 --> 00:25:58,070
Really?

505
00:25:58,190 --> 00:26:00,710
My mom does work really hard.

506
00:26:00,740 --> 00:26:02,610
I'd love to
take some of the pressure off her.

507
00:26:02,610 --> 00:26:03,570
Isn't that perfect?

508
00:26:03,570 --> 00:26:05,030
Making a bit of side money is no problem.

509
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:06,610
Honestly, you could just add me now.

510
00:26:06,610 --> 00:26:07,640
With my level,

511
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:09,500
reaching 1,800 is a piece of cake.

512
00:26:09,660 --> 00:26:10,850
Rules are rules.

513
00:26:10,850 --> 00:26:11,880
Get to 1,600 first.

514
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:13,210
We'll talk after you do.

515
00:26:13,830 --> 00:26:14,590
Deal.

516
00:26:22,600 --> 00:26:24,570
Han, I'm heading home now.

517
00:26:25,330 --> 00:26:27,220
Why are you going back so early today?

518
00:26:27,220 --> 00:26:28,510
My mom's electric scooter broke down.

519
00:26:28,510 --> 00:26:30,240
I'm going back to fix it for her.

520
00:26:30,330 --> 00:26:31,960
Alright. Then come early tomorrow.

521
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:32,960
Let's queue up and game together.

522
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:33,740
See you tomorrow.

523
00:26:33,740 --> 00:26:34,280
Bye.

524
00:27:20,760 --> 00:27:22,780
[Team Showdown; Battle for Our Dreams]

525
00:27:24,640 --> 00:27:26,180
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

526
00:27:39,860 --> 00:27:42,110
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

527
00:27:47,590 --> 00:27:50,020
Everything's cheaper now!
Come take a look!

528
00:27:50,020 --> 00:27:51,430
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

529
00:29:08,810 --> 00:29:10,410
The guests have all entered.

530
00:29:10,610 --> 00:29:12,070
The show is about to begin.

531
00:29:12,660 --> 00:29:14,390
I really can't wait any longer.

532
00:29:14,910 --> 00:29:16,040
Stick to the plan.

533
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:19,200
Don't give up at the last moment.

534
00:29:20,120 --> 00:29:20,920
I won't.

535
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:39,890
What are you doing? Keep it away!

536
00:29:39,890 --> 00:29:41,420
I-I want to send something.

537
00:29:44,380 --> 00:29:46,220
The info is all written on it.

538
00:29:46,220 --> 00:29:47,640
Please fill it out for me.

539
00:29:47,570 --> 00:29:48,590
[From: Xiaofei] [To: Song Laifu]

540
00:29:47,800 --> 00:29:49,740
Just put this as the sender's address.

541
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,590
[Address: Song Laifu,
Huangzhiyuan Hotel–Mailroom]

542
00:29:49,770 --> 00:29:51,220
This is same-city delivery, right?

543
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:52,310
We have 2 options.

544
00:29:52,350 --> 00:29:53,330
Express is 10 yuan,

545
00:29:53,330 --> 00:29:53,940
and standard is 6.

546
00:29:53,940 --> 00:29:54,570
Which would you like?

547
00:29:54,570 --> 00:29:55,140
Express.

548
00:29:55,530 --> 00:29:55,960
Okay.

549
00:29:56,110 --> 00:29:56,850
Thank you.

550
00:29:57,150 --> 00:30:01,860
[Daxin Street Bus Stop]

551
00:30:07,090 --> 00:30:09,410
[Bus]

552
00:30:15,610 --> 00:30:17,540
Buy your ticket before getting on.

553
00:30:34,300 --> 00:30:37,990
[Daxin Street Bus Stop]

554
00:30:38,050 --> 00:30:39,480
[Bus]

555
00:30:44,320 --> 00:30:46,600
[Bus]

556
00:31:48,990 --> 00:31:49,990
Stop right there.

557
00:31:51,990 --> 00:31:52,870
Who are you?

558
00:31:54,250 --> 00:31:55,650
Why are you following me?

559
00:31:57,440 --> 00:31:58,720
I'm not following you.

560
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,290
I'm here to see a friend.

561
00:32:01,420 --> 00:32:02,310
Bullshit.

562
00:32:02,330 --> 00:32:04,000
I spotted you back on the road.

563
00:32:04,570 --> 00:32:06,400
Man, you're mistaken.

564
00:32:09,010 --> 00:32:10,700
Tell me, who sent you?

565
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:12,780
If you keep this up, I won't hold back.

566
00:32:17,800 --> 00:32:18,660
Li Cheng?

567
00:32:20,460 --> 00:32:21,160
Xin?

568
00:32:26,750 --> 00:32:27,980
You're from Huangshui.

569
00:32:27,980 --> 00:32:28,510
Yes.

570
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,720
Then have you heard of

571
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:33,060
the major case around here 8 years ago

572
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:35,160
that shocked the whole province?

573
00:32:37,420 --> 00:32:38,690
[Victim No. 1] [Victim No. 2]
[Victim No. 3]

574
00:32:39,230 --> 00:32:40,470
3/12 Case?
